<p>On my laptop, a Thinkpad X1 Carbon with Intel chipset, I can set the
screen brightness to max with this simple command:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ cat /sys/class/backlight/intel_backlight/max_brightness | 
  sudo tee /sys/class/backlight/intel_backlight/brightness
</code></pre></div>

<p>Of course, you can set it to any value, as long as it doesn't exceed
the value in <code>max_brightness</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ cat /sys/class/backlight/intel_backlight/max_brightness 
19393
$ echo 1800 | sudo tee /sys/class/backlight/intel_backlight/brightness
$
</code></pre></div>